<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected this week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY----PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>SUN  Momentum   YR EPS  92.3	  91.0-95.0    72.8</p>
<p>SUN  Momentum   YR DIV  50.7	  50.0-52.0    40.5</p>
<p>MON  Sasol	YR EPS  390.0	 385.0-400.0  323</p>
<p>MON  Sasol	YR DIV  120.0	 116.0-130.0  102</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
